Description: color-managed image viewer with lossless editing
 losles is a lightweight GTK image viewer that converts embedded image
 profiles directly to the ICC profile selected for the active monitor. It
 supports wide-gamut RGB display profiles and provides an explicit sRGB
 fallback when no monitor profile is available.
 .
 It displays JPEG and PNG images and provides coefficient-lossless JPEG
 rotation and cropping together with pixel-lossless editing of common 8-bit
 PNG formats.
